Subject: [PATCH] Restore C++ bool after parsing the ncurses declarations

The selected ncurses ABI defines bool as NCURSES_BOOL. Limit that
compatibility macro to the header so standard C++ templates and program
declarations keep their native bool type. Public ncurses headers and
their function declarations remain unchanged.

--- a/src/process.cpp
+++ b/src/process.cpp
@@ -22,6 +22,10 @@
 
 #include <iostream>
 #include <ncurses.h>
+/* Keep ncurses declarations intact, then restore the C++ bool keyword. */
+#ifdef bool
+#undef bool
+#endif
 #include <set>
 #include <string>
 #include <strings.h>
--- a/src/cui.cpp
+++ b/src/cui.cpp
@@ -32,6 +32,10 @@
 #include "nethogs.h"
 #include "process.h"
 #include <ncurses.h>
+/* Keep ncurses declarations intact, then restore the C++ bool keyword. */
+#ifdef bool
+#undef bool
+#endif
 
 std::string *caption;
 static int cursOrig;
